    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "4.教授運輸或物流相關政策與法規內涵及時事之評析能力",
      "describe_en": "4. Provide students with knowledge of transportation and logistics-related policies and regulations, and develop their ability to analyze current issues."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "12.培養學生簡報製作、報告撰寫、口頭報告以及提問研討之能力",
      "describe_en": "12. Develop students' skills in presentation, report writing, oral delivery, and academic discussion."
    }
